{"id":"wb-5-290","name":"黄山八面厅","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"黄山八面厅","text":"黄山八面厅位于中国浙江省义乌市上溪镇黄山村，2001年被列为第五批全国重点文物保护单位。\n八面厅于清乾隆、嘉庆时期由当地富商陈子采建造。整个建筑平面呈长方形，坐西南朝东北，长约70米，宽约40米。其内部有大量的砖雕、石雕及木雕，尤以木雕最为精美绝伦。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%BB%84%E5%B1%B1%E5%85%AB%E9%9D%A2%E5%8E%85","revisionId":84932785,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=84932785","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/1584d9c2a5f882d8e33274ef.jpg","title":"Huangshan_Bamian_Hall,_2021-09-21_01.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Huangshan_Bamian_Hall,_2021-09-21_01.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b8/Huangshan_Bamian_Hall%2C_2021-09-21_01.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Siyuwj","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​义乌黄山八面厅","width":320,"height":214}}